If it cannot find your script or the clips it will ask for the path. It writes a result file such as result-2026-NV-1C-20260907.json into the directory you ran it from.

Run it on the unmodified boilerplate

The tool imports your detect_lane() directly. If you renamed the file or the function, changed the keys of the returned dictionary, or left a cv2.imshow() / cv2.waitKey() inside detect_lane(), the run will fail or hang and no result file is written.